{"d":33,"passage":{"title":"道林·格雷的画像","author":"Oscar Wilde","text":"The critic is he who can translate into another manner or a new material his impression of beautiful things. The nineteenth century dislike of realism is the rage of Caliban seeing his own face in a glass. The nineteenth century dislike of romanticism is the rage of Caliban not seeing his own face in a glass. The moral life of man forms part of the subject-matter of the artist, but the morality of art consists in the perfect use of an imperfect medium. Diversity of opinion about a work of art shows that the work is new, complex, and vital. The sullen murmur of the bees shouldering their way through the long unmown grass, or circling with monotonous insistence round the dusty gilt horns of the straggling woodbine, seemed to make the stillness more oppressive. As the painter looked at the gracious and comely form he had so skilfully mirrored in his art, a smile of pleasure passed across his face, and seemed about to linger there."},"words":[{"w":"configuration","uk":"kən.figju'reiʃən","us":"/kən.figju'reiʃən/","p":"n.","m":"n. 结构, 表面配置, 外形, 配置 [计] 配置","f":[],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":null},{"w":"cds","uk":"","us":"","p":"","m":"abbr. 中央动态存贮器（Central Dynamic Store）；集装箱运货系（Co…","f":[],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":null},{"w":"ipod","uk":"","us":"","p":"","m":"n. 苹果公司音乐播放器","f":[],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":null},{"w":"motorola","uk":"","us":"","p":"","m":"n. 摩托罗拉（美国主营电子的公司）","f":[],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":null},{"w":"affiliates","uk":"əˈfilieits","us":"/əˈfilieits/","p":"","m":"n. 附属企业( affiliate的名词复数 ) v. 使隶属于, 接纳…为成员( aff…","f":[],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":null},{"w":"computing","uk":"kəm'pjuːtiŋ","us":"/kəm'pjuːtiŋ/","p":"","m":"[计] 计算","f":[],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":null},{"w":"interactive","uk":",intər'æktiv","us":"/,intər'æktiv/","p":"adj.","m":"a. 相互作用的, 相互影响的 [计] 交互, 人机对话的","f":[],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":null},{"w":"kong","uk":"kɔŋ","us":"/kɔŋ/","p":"","m":"n. 含锡砾石下的无矿基岩；钢